      <title>Federal Reserve Must Raise Rates Again to Tame Persistent Inflation</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-10/federal-reserve-must-raise-rates-again-to-tame-persistent-inflation</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">946f69abb173db8d0c40fce9</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:00:12 +0000</pubDate>
